{"type":"message","id":"45269c62","parentId":"4554999f","timestamp":"2026-05-25T21:47:11.344Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me analyze the options:\n\n**Current state:**\n- `hermes-skills` (remote) - currently the git origin, has workspace files\n- `hermes-sync` - a separate repo for cross-platform soul/memory sync\n- Workspace has: memory (25 files, 164K), chanlun-agent (1.6M), scripts (24K), skills (1.4M), plus identity/config files\n\n**VAN's requirement:**\n1. Memory + session + local sync\n2. Full backup\n3. One-click restore on any platform\n\n**Option A: Branch in hermes-sync**\n- Pros: Already has the sync pattern, single repo\n\n\n- Cons: hermes-sync is for cross-platform soul sync, mixing trading system in it\n\n**Option B: New \"AI Trading sync\" repo**\n- Pros: Clean separation, trading-specific, can have its own structure\n- Cons: Another repo to manage\n\nI think a new repo makes more sense because the trading system (1.6M chanlun-agent) is large and specific to VAN's setup, hermes-sync is for the multi-platform identity/soul pattern, and having a dedicated trading sync repo lets me structure it specifically for backup and restore operations. But I'll present both options to VAN and let them decide.\n\nNow I'm thinking through what the actual sync structure should look like. I need to organize it with a restore script at the root, a config directory for identity and settings, a memory directory for historical and session data, the trading agent code, skills, and scripts.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"查完了。现有结构：\n\n| 仓库 | 内容 | 大小 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `hermes-skills` (当前origin) | workspace 文件 | 已有 |\n| `hermes-sync` | 跨平台灵魂/记忆同步 | 52文件 |\n\n**我的建议：新建 `ai-trading-sync` 仓库。** 理由：\n\n1. **职责分离** — hermes-sync 是跨平台身份同步（豆包/Kimi/OpenClaw），交易系统是独立业务\n2. **体量差异** — chanlun-agent 1.6M，混进 hermes-sync 会臃肿\n3. **恢复粒度** — 独立仓库可以单独恢复交易环境，不影响其他平台身份\n\n仓库结构：\n\n```\nai-trading-sync/\n├── restore.sh                    # 一键恢复脚本\n├── README.md                     # 说明文档\n├── .gitignore\n├── config/                       # 身份配置\n│   ├── AGENTS.md\n│   ├── IDENTITY.md\n│   ├── USER.md\n│   ├── SOUL.md\n│   └── HEARTBEAT.md\n├── memory/                       # 记忆系统\n│   ├── MEMORY.md                 # 长期记忆\n│   ├── *.md                      # 每日记忆\n│   └── sessions/                 # Session归档\n├── chanlun-agent/                # 缠论交易系统\n│   ├── *.py                      # 核心代码\n│   ├── knowledge/                # 知识库\n│   └── paper-trading/            # 模拟交易\n├── scripts/                      # 自动化脚本\n├── skills/                       # 技能目录（可选）\n└── knowledge/                    # 全局知识库\n```\n\n**一键恢复流程：**\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync.git\ncd ai-trading-sync\nbash restore.sh  # 自动软链接到 workspace，恢复全部状态\n```\n\nVAN，要我现在建吗？需要你给一个 GitHub PAT（和 hermes-sync 同一个就行）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1064,"output":1143,"cacheRead":104064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106271,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779745616752}}
