{"type":"message","id":"8d019380","parentId":"848e34f9","timestamp":"2026-05-25T21:48:08.617Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the .gitignore and README.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c59f5cd25be54ad0b1b1f16d","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# AI Trading Sync - .gitignore\n\n# 敏感文件（永不提交）\nSECRET.md\n*.pem\n*.key\n*.secret\n.env\n\n# 日志\n*.log\nlogs/\n\n# Python\n__pycache__/\n*.pyc\n*.pyo\n.eggs/\n*.egg-info/\n\n# IDE\n.vscode/\n.idea/\n*.swp\n*.swo\n\n# OS\n.DS_Store\nThumbs.db\n\n# 临时文件\n*.tmp\n*.bak\n","path":"/tmp/ai-trading-sync/.gitignore"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9d38da78f6424372b51a5303","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 🦞 AI Trading Sync\n\nVAN 的 AI 交易系统 — 记忆/Session/代码同步仓库\n\n## 包含内容\n\n| 目录 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| `config/` | 身份配置（AGENTS/IDENTITY/USER/SOUL/HEARTBEAT/TOOLS） |\n| `memory/` | 长期记忆 + 每日记忆 + Session归档 |\n| `chanlun-agent/` | 缠论交易系统（11个模块，~3200行） |\n| `scripts/` | 自动化脚本（记忆/归档/归档清理） |\n| `knowledge/` | 缠论知识库 + 元交易体系 |\n\n## 一键恢复\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync.git\ncd ai-trading-sync\nbash restore.sh\n```\n\n默认恢复到 `/workspace/projects/workspace`，可自定义：\n```bash\nbash restore.sh /path/to/your/workspace\n```\n\n## 核心模块\n\n- **czsc_extension.py** — 智能级别确立（结构状态驱动 + 流畅度分析）\n- **live_paper_trader.py** — 实时交易模拟（趋势跟随/盘整突破/反转捕捉）\n- **risk_engine.py** — 三级风控（技术/时间/资金止损 + 连亏熔断）\n- **reflection_engine.py** — 自动反思（交易后/连亏/周度/参数优化）\n- **structure_debug.py** — 盘中调试工具\n\n## VAN 的核心原则\n\n> 凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空。\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- `SECRET.md` 不在此仓库（API Keys）\n- 敏感配置使用 git-crypt 加密（待实施）\n- 每日自动备份：cron 任务会定期同步\n","path":"/tmp/ai-trading-sync/README.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1108,"output":608,"cacheRead":107712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109428,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779745678484}}
