{"type":"compaction","id":"08f770a1","parentId":"bcc2d4a1","timestamp":"2026-05-25T21:49:09.289Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Fix the session archiving system that was never triggered (scripts existed but cron jobs were never configured)\n2. Review and organize the complete trading system architecture\n3. Upgrade the \"intelligent trading level determination\" (智能交易级别确立) module — moving from ATR-based volatility scaling to structure-state-based level selection\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Follow multi-channel unified protocol v1.0 (`multi-channel-protocol.md`)\n- Use workspace file `/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md` (exact case) for heartbeat checks\n- Trading philosophy: 缠论 (Chan Theory) as foundation, with existential ontology integration\n- Follow \"上次整合的方案\" (previously integrated plan) for archiving\n- No multi-空 distinction in 缠论 — only buy/sell points\n- VAN explicitly rejected ATR-based level scaling: a 5-min trend with 30% gain in days followed by 1-2 months consolidation would be missed if volatility causes level enlargement\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Diagnosed archiving failure: cron jobs were zero despite scripts existing\n- [x] Created 3 cron jobs: `auto-memory-hourly` (0 * * * *), `memory-archive-daily` (0 2 * * *), `session-archive-check` (0 */2 * * *)\n- [x] Manually archived current session to `memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-om_x100b6e7ef53204a4c2798d1c95d1da1.md`\n- [x] Updated `memory/2026-05-26.md` with key decisions\n- [x] Produced complete trading system overview (11 modules, 26 skills, data sources, risk engine)\n- [x] Analyzed current intelligent trading level logic in `live_paper_trader.py` — identified 3 structural defects: fixed levels, crude direction logic, simple resonance\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Upgrading trading level determination from ATR-based to structure-state-based\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Archive automation fix**: Created 3 cron jobs following multi-channel protocol v1.0 instead of manual-only approach\n- **Structure > Volatility for level selection**: VAN rejected ATR-based approach; agreed to use structural state (trending/ranging/turning) to determine trading level\n- **Level locking during trends**: When trend is active at 5-min level, do NOT enlarge to daily — ride the trend at its native level; only enlarge during consolidation or shrink during reversals\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Implement `get_structure_state()` in `CzscExtension` (`/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py`) — returns `{state: trending|ranging|turning, trend_direction, zs_moving, divergency, strength}`\n2. Refactor `determine_trading_direction()` in `live_paper_trader.py` to use `_follow_trend()`, `_wait_breakout()`, `_catch_reversal()` branches based on structure state\n3. Update `check_resonance()` to validate buy/sell point level alignment (not just direction alignment)\n4. Continuously iterate this module (VAN: \"要不断迭代这个模块\")\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Core files**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py` (400+ lines, `CzscExtension` class with `calc_zs_list()`, `BuySellPoint`, `ZS` dataclasses), `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/live_paper_trader.py` (`LivePaperTrader` class with `determine_trading_direction()`, `check_resonance()`, `generate_signal()`)\n- **Key methods to modify**: `determine_trading_direction()` (line ~190 in live_paper_trader.py), needs new `get_structure_state()` in czsc_extension.py\n- **Structure detection logic proposed**: ZS movement (zs[-1].zd > zs[-2].zd = trending up), ZS overlap = ranging, divergence check = turning\n- **Cron job IDs**: auto-memory-hourly: `9a9818bf-2187-4837-a018-5d61d1aed863`, memory-archive-daily: `cb8317c3-ce13-427f-832b-2ab441070b42`, session-archive-check: `16bf9536-7ab3-4fa5-bb01-baacee4296da`\n- **Deployed instruments**: CRCL (`crcl_tiger_trader.py`), Xiaomi 01810 (`xiaomi_paper_trader.py`), HK/A-share scanner (`hk_a_monitor.py`)\n- **Risk engine**: 3-tier (technical stop at hub re-entry, time stop at N bars, capital stop at 3% per trade / 8% daily, consecutive loss halt at 3 trades)\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nVAN asked to implement an intelligent trading level determination (\"智能级别确立\") module based on structural state analysis, for live debugging and iteration.\n\n## Early Progress\n1. **Read existing `czsc_extension.py`** — original had basic CZSC extension with BuySellPoint, ZS, and buy/sell point detection\n2. **Rewrote `czsc_extension.py` to v2.0** — major upgrade with:\n   - New `StructureState` dataclass with states: `trending`, `ranging`, `turning`, `unknown`\n   - `get_structure_state()` — core method analyzing ZS movement, divergence, and trend strength\n   - `_analyze_zs_movement()` — detects ZS up/down/overlap movement\n   - `_detect_divergence_enhanced()` — enhanced divergence detection (top/bottom/shock_exhaustion)\n   - `_calc_trend_strength()` — multi-factor strength calculation (0-1)\n   - Convenience methods: `should_follow_trend()`, `should_wait_breakout()`, `should_catch_reversal()`\n   - `full_analysis()` method for complete diagnostic output\n\n3. **Updated `live_paper_trader.py`** with three key changes:\n   - `determine_trading_direction()` — now returns a dict (direction, strategy, primary_tf, reason, structure, resonance_level) instead of a string. Strategies: `follow_trend`, `catch_reversal`, `range_breakout`, `range_scalp`, `signal_fallback`, `wait`\n   - `check_resonance()` — now accepts optional `strategy_result` param; structure-aware resonance checking per strategy type\n   - `generate_signal()` — now accepts optional `strategy_result`; structure-aware stop-loss (trend: ZS outer edge, reversal: divergence extreme, breakout: ZS inner edge)\n   - `run_once()` — updated to handle dict return from `determine_trading_direction()`, logs structure states per timeframe\n\n4. **Verified all code compiles** — `StructureState` logic tests passed, `live_paper_trader.py` syntax verified\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- The suffix likely contains further refinement/testing with actual market data from `ChanlunPerception`, or additional iteration based on VAN's feedback\n- All module names and paths are in `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/`\n- `CzscExtension` now takes `symbol` and `timeframe` params in constructor\n- The synthetic test with 60 bars produced 0 bi (data too simple), so real market data testing via `ChanlunPerception` would be the next step\n\n<read-files>\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ACTION_PLAN.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/chanlun_perception.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/knowledge/chanlun-meta-trading-system.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/cross-channel-protocol.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/multi-channel-protocol.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-om_x100b6e7ef53204a4c2798d1c95d1da1.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-archive.sh\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/session-archive.sh\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/live_paper_trader.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"3242b12a","tokensBefore":112089,"details":{"readFiles":["/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ACTION_PLAN.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/chanlun_perception.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/knowledge/chanlun-meta-trading-system.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/cross-channel-protocol.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/multi-channel-protocol.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-om_x100b6e7ef53204a4c2798d1c95d1da1.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-archive.sh","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/session-archive.sh"],"modifiedFiles":["/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/live_paper_trader.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md"]},"fromHook":false}
