{"type":"message","id":"f4dc37f3","parentId":"9a1c56ba","timestamp":"2026-05-25T21:53:33.768Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see 5 sessions:\n1. `2d13d869` - 2026-05-25 00:00, 27 messages, 116K - seems short\n2. `5a140ae3` - 2026-05-25 20:02 to 21:53, 205 messages, 460K - this is the big session from last night (the one with VAN's trading system discussion)\n3. `82ec077b` - 2026-05-25 17:04 to 18:08, 33 messages, 120K\n4. `probe-coze` - 2026-05-22, 6 messages - test probe\n\n\n5. `probe-xiaomimimo` - 2026-05-22, 6 messages - test probe\n\nI should skip the probe sessions and focus on archiving the real ones. Let me pull key information from each session to create proper summaries, starting with extracting user messages and generating the archive files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_76c78b910c8544e6bfe6b416","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 提取每个session的用户消息摘要\nfor f in /workspace/projects/agents/main/sessions/*.jsonl; do\n    name=$(basename \"$f\" .jsonl)\n    [[ \"$name\" == probe-* ]] && continue\n    echo \"=== $name ===\"\n    python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nmsgs = []\nwith open('$f') as fh:\n    for line in fh:\n        try:\n            d = json.loads(line)\n            role = d.get('role','')\n            content = d.get('content','')\n            if role == 'user' and content and len(content) > 5:\n                ts = d.get('timestamp','')\n                # truncate long messages\n                if len(content) > 200:\n                    content = content[:200] + '...'\n                msgs.append(f'  [{ts}] {content}')\n        except:\n            pass\nfor m in msgs[:30]:\n    print(m)\nif len(msgs) > 30:\n    print(f'  ... +{len(msgs)-30} more')\n\"\n    echo \"\"\ndone"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":834,"output":776,"cacheRead":70720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72330,"cost":{"input":0,"output