{"type":"message","id":"41405227","parentId":"f06db265","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:01:56.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking about the current sync and backup mechanism between local and the repository. Let me explain the current setup clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"当前机制：\n\n## 本地 ↔ 仓库 同步\n\n```\n本地 workspace                          GitHub 仓库\n/workspace/projects/workspace    ←→     xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync\n├── memory/                             ├── memory/\n│   ├── MEMORY.md                       │   ├── MEMORY.md\n│   ├── 2026-*.md (25个)                │   ├── 2026-*.md\n│   └── sessions/ (5个)                 │   └── sessions/\n├── chanlun-agent/ (15个.py)            ├── chanlun-agent/\n├── scripts/ (4个.sh)                   ├── scripts/\n├── knowledge/                          ├── knowledge/\n├── AGENTS/IDENTITY/USER/SOUL...        ├── config/\n└── paper-trading/                      └── paper-trading/\n```\n\n## 同步方式\n\n| 方式 | 触发 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **手动同步** | 我执行 git push | ✅ 已用（凌晨2次） |\n| **cron自动同步** | 定时推送到仓库 | ❌ 未配置 |\n\n## 备份覆盖范围\n\n| 类型 | 备份频率 | 内容 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| 记忆文件 | 每小时 auto-memory 更新本地 | 下次手动push时同步 |\n| Session归档 | 每2小时检查+归档 | 下次手动push时同步 |\n| 交易代码 | 代码变更时 | 下次手动push时同步 |\n\n## 问题\n\n**本地和仓库之间没有自动同步。** 归档和记忆是自动更新到本地的，但推送到 GitHub 需要手动执行或额外 cron。\n\n要加一个自动推送的 cron 吗？比如每6小时自动 `git push` 到 ai-trading-sync。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":978,"output":456,"cacheRead":77120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78554,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779746506164}}
