{"type":"message","id":"bb84f7fe","parentId":"bc4027b2","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:04:59.192Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. The session archive is created and synced. Let me give VAN a brief update.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Session 归档检查 ✅\n\n新增：`2026-05-26-feishu-2026-05-26-05to06.md`（05:31-06:05 续：备份+补录+同步机制讨论）\n\n备份仓库已同步（a019f27）。现在共 6 个 session 归档。\n\nVAN，关于自动推送——要我现在加一个每6小时自动 `git push` 的 cron 吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":334,"output":154,"cacheRead":79808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80296,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779746691737}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa7dcfee","parentId":"bb84f7fe","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:04:59.244Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Queued messages while agent was busy]\n\n---\nQueued #1\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e7836428890c422b88dbbf4f21\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 06:04 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e7836428890c422b88dbbf4f21]\nVAN: 能自动尽量全自动，频率可以按需调调整。"}],"timestamp":1779746699240}}
{"type":"message","id":"80851817","parentId":"aa7dcfee","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:05:12.853Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants automatic sync to GitHub, fully automated, with adjustable frequency. Let me create a sync script and a cron job for it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7b84ed0b271848a0830853e4","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"#!/bin/bash\n# sync-to-backup.sh — 自动同步本地到 ai-trading-sync 仓库\n# 用法: bash sync-to-backup.sh [commit_message]\n\nset -euo pipefail\n\nWORKSPACE=\"/workspace/projects/workspace\"\nBACKUP_DIR=\"/tmp/ai-trading-sync-$$\"\nTOKEN=$(cd /workspace/projects && git remote get-url origin | sed 's/.*:\\/\\/[^:]*:\\([^@]*\\)@.*/\\1/')\nREMOTE=\"https://xianfanhuang:${TOKEN}@github.com/xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync.git\"\nMSG=\"${1:-auto-sync: $(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')}\"\n\n# 克隆\ngit clone -q \"$REMOTE\" \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\ncd \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n\n# 同步记忆\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/memory/*.md memory/ 2>/dev/null || true\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/memory/sessions/*.md memory/sessions/ 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 同步交易代码\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/chanlun-agent/*.py chanlun-agent/ 2>/dev/null || true\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/chanlun-agent/*.md chanlun-agent/ 2>/dev/null || true\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/*.py chanlun-agent/paper-trading/ 2>/dev/null || true\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/*.json chanlun-agent/paper-trading/ 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 同步脚本\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/scripts/*.sh scripts/ 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 同步配置\nfor f in AGENTS.md IDENTITY.md USER.md SOUL.md HEARTBEAT.md TOOLS.md; do\n    cp \"$WORKSPACE/$f\" config/\"$f\" 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\n\n# 同步模拟交易\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/paper-trading/*.json paper-trading/ 2>/dev/null || true\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/paper-trading/*.md paper-trading/ 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 同步知识库\ncp \"$WORKSPACE\"/knowledge/*.md knowledge/ 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# 检查是否有变更\nif git diff --quiet && git diff --cached --quiet; then\n    echo \"[sync] 无变更，跳过\"\n    rm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n    exit 0\nfi\n\n# 提交并推送\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"$MSG\"\ngit push -q\n\necho \"[sync] ✅ 已同步: $(git diff --stat HEAD~1 --shortstat)\"\n\n# 清理\nrm -rf \"$BACKUP_DIR\"\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/sync-to-backup.sh"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":72390,"output":693,"cacheRead":8192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81275,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779746699244}}
