{"type":"message","id":"453dee86","parentId":"74d073ac","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:05:39.245Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the complete picture. Let me give VAN a clean summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"全自动已就位 ✅\n\n## 完整自动化流水线\n\n```\n本地 workspace\n    │\n    ├── 每小时 → auto-memory（更新今日记忆）\n    ├── 每2小时 → session-archive（归档活跃session）\n    ├── 每6小时 → sync-to-backup（推送全部到 GitHub）\n    └── 每天02:00 → memory-archive（压缩30天前记忆+清理旧session）\n\nGitHub: xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync (私有)\n```\n\n## 4个 Cron 任务\n\n| 任务 | 周期 | 功能 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `auto-memory-hourly` | 每小时 | 更新本地记忆 |\n| `session-archive-check` | 每2小时 | 归档活跃session |\n| `backup-sync` | 每6小时 | **全量同步到 GitHub** ← 新增 |\n| `memory-archive-daily` | 每天02:00 | 压缩清理旧记忆 |\n\n## 同步内容\n\n记忆 + session归档 + 交易代码 + 脚本 + 配置 + 知识库 + 模拟交易数据\n\n频率可以随时调，比如改成每3小时（`0 */3 * * *`）或每小时（`0 * * * *`）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1383,"output":330,"cacheRead":81920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83633,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779746733323}}
