{"type":"message","id":"6166dcb8","parentId":"ec3b9f5f","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:16:20.023Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - there are 16 .md files in the workspace root, not 6. The 6 I mentioned in the backup were: AGENTS.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, SOUL.md, HEARTBEAT.md, TOOLS.md. VAN is questioning why only 6 when there are more identity-related files. Let me clarify.\n\nActually, looking at it again, VAN might be asking why I only backed up 6 config files when there are more. Or VAN might be pointing out that some files are missing from the backup.\n\nThe key identity files are: AGENTS.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, SOUL.md, HEARTBEAT.md, TOOLS.md - these 6 define who the agent is. \n\nThe rest of the .md files like MEMORY.md, BOOTSTRAP.md, and the various analysis and design docs aren't identity configuration files - they're operational documentation and reports. So the 6 I selected are the core identity configs, and that's the right scope for the backup.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"备份里 `config/` 只放了 6 个核心身份文件：AGENTS / IDENTITY / USER / SOUL / HEARTBEAT / TOOLS\n\n根目录其实有 16 个 .md 文件，其中：\n\n| 类型 | 文件 | 备份位置 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| 身份配置 | AGENTS, IDENTITY, USER, SOUL, HEARTBEAT, TOOLS | `config/` |\n| 长期记忆 | MEMORY.md | `memory/` |\n| 知识文档 | BOOTSTRAP, TRADING_SYSTEM, SIGNAL_GENERATOR 等 | 未备份 |\n| 设计文档 | AUTO_MEMORY_DESIGN, SESSION_CONTEXT_ANALYSIS 等 | 未备份 |\n| 敏感 | SECRET.md | .gitignore 排除 |\n\n要把剩余的文档也加进备份吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":224,"output":616,"cacheRead":87424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88264,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779747372323}}
