{"type":"message","id":"cabec9a2","parentId":"813153b9","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:33:20.292Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to:\n1. Unify the identity config files\n2. Use \"Captain\" as the unified address for VAN\n3. Core role = 自主交易项目负责人 (Autonomous Trading Project Lead)\n4. Reference today's team identity alignment document\n\nLet me find the team identity alignment document first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f297ebb112bf46128c78f27a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/team-identity-registry.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_25ec4ba66f724b34b02ac410","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /workspace/projects/workspace -name \"*alignment*\" -o -name \"*identity*align*\" -o -name \"*agent-identity*\" 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":756,"output":212,"cacheRead":91072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92040,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779748334292}}
{"type":"message","id":"5b1ae9ed","parentId":"cabec9a2","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:33:20.311Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f297ebb112bf46128c78f27a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 团队身份注册表\n\n## 身份核验原则\n\n1. **主认证渠道: 飞书** — 所有敏感操作必须飞书确认\n2. **首次跨平台接入** — 必须经已认证成员确认\n3. **已绑定身份** — 后续自动识别，无需重复验证\n4. **敏感操作分级** — 不同操作有不同核验强度\n\n---\n\n## 成员注册\n\n### VAN（投资人/董事长）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | `ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683` | ✅ 主认证 |\n\n**权限:** 最高决策权，可确认他人身份绑定\n\n### Top Sailor（COO）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | `oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981`（群成员） | ✅ 已绑定 |\n| 豆包 | `待绑定` | ⏳ 待接入 |\n\n**确认流程:** Top Sailor 首次从新平台接入时，系统自动在飞书通知 VAN 确认\n\n### Trading Assistant（AI 交易助手）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | bot | ✅ 活跃 |\n| Kimi | kimi-claw | ✅ 活跃 |\n\n---\n\n## 飞书群注册\n\n| 群名 | 群 ID | 成员 |\n|------|-------|------|\n| 主协作群 | `oc_33d478474b841e1f25250090ab3e3835` | VAN, Top Sailor, TA |\n\n---\n\n## 操作分级\n\n| 级别 | 操作 | 核验要求 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 🔴 高 | 交易指令、密钥访问、配置变更 | 飞书确认 + 口令 |\n| 🟡 中 | 身份绑定、新渠道接入 | 飞书确认 |\n| 🟢 低 | 查看持仓、市场分析 | 已绑定渠道即可 |\n\n---\n\n## 新渠道接入流程\n\n```\n1. 新成员在目标平台发送: \"我是 [角色名]\"\n2. 系统自动在飞书通知 VAN:\n   \"[角色名] 请求从 [平台] 接入，确认？\"\n3. VAN 在飞书回复确认\n4. 系统绑定身份，后续自动识别\n```\n\n---\n\n## 验证口令（每日轮换）\n\n- **格式:** 元觉智能 + 当天日期（YYYYMMDD）\n- **示例:** 元觉智能20260525\n- **有效期:** 当天 00:00 ~ 23:59\n- **设置人:** VAN（仅 VAN 可修改格式）\n- **用途:** 高风险操作二次确认 / 新渠道接入加速确认\n\n---\n\n*最后更新: 2026-05-25*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779748400311}}
{"type":"message","id":"40af51b3","parentId":"5b1ae9ed","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:33:20.314Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_25ec4ba66f724b34b02ac410","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/meta-sensory/team-alignment-manual-v1.0.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/meta-sensory/identities/agent-identity-alignment-v1.1.1.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":9,"aggregated":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/meta-sensory/team-alignment-manual-v1.0.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/hermes-skills/meta-sensory/identities/agent-identity-alignment-v1.1.1.md","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779748400314}}
