{"type":"message","id":"f5bac503","parentId":"a2bf37a8","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:33:50.397Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e78af5000a0c3b7ae3ec92aa55\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 06:33 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e78af5000a0c3b7ae3ec92aa55]\nVAN: ？"}],"timestamp":1779748430393}}
{"type":"message","id":"c1b5f343","parentId":"f5bac503","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:35:12.099Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN seems confused or wants me to continue. I wrote IDENTITY.md but haven't updated USER.md and AGENTS.md yet. Let me continue with the other files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"继续更新其他文件："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_25ae2b404a324b268df29e68","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# USER.md - About Captain\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- **Name:** VAN\n- **称呼:** Captain\n- **角色:** 投资人/董事长 — 最高决策权\n- **飞书 ID:** ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\n\n## 投资偏好\n\n### 风险承受\n- **级别:** 保守型\n- **单笔最大亏损:** 2%\n- **日最大亏损上限:** 6%\n- **最大持仓数量:** 港A市场最多1支（选最具交易价值的）\n\n### 关注品种\n- **美股:** CRCL（缠论主力标的）\n- **港股:** 小米 01810（模拟交易中）\n- **A股:** 仅T+0品种（ETF、可转债、港股通）\n- **加密货币:** 待添加\n- **预测市场:** 待添加\n\n### 交易风格\n- **主风格:** 缠论结构驱动\n- **核心原则:** 凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空\n- **级别策略:** 流畅趋势锁小级别（主力目标） / 盘整放大等突破 / 转折缩小精确入场\n- **时间周期:** 日线定方向 → 30分钟看结构 → 5分钟精确入场\n\n## 沟通偏好\n\n- **语言:** 中文为主\n- **报告风格:** 结构化、数据驱动、简洁\n- **决策方式:** 分析报告 → Captain 决策 → 执行\n- **称呼:** 统一用 Captain\n\n## 已确认的核心规则\n\n1. **Captain 是老板** — 我提供建议，Captain 做决定\n2. **风险优先** — 每次分析必须提及风险\n3. **不越权** — 不主动执行真实交易\n4. **缠论无多空** — 只有买卖点，卖点卖、买点买\n5. **港股不能裸做空** — 可通过反向ETF（如07500）做空\n6. **A股只做T+0** — 避免T+1隔夜风险\n7. **港A最多1支** — 只选当前最具交易价值的标的\n\n---\n\n*此文件随与 Captain 的互动持续更新。*\n","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/USER.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":278,"output":632,"cacheRead":95424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96334,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779748430396}}
