{"type":"message","id":"7fe72ca0","parentId":"fa06d482","timestamp":"2026-05-25T22:55:11.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking about skills not loading in new sessions. The skills are installed in the workspace, but they might not be getting loaded into the system prompt. Let me check how OpenClaw loads skills and what the system prompt includes.\n\nLooking at the system prompt at the top of this conversation, I can see there IS an `<available_skills>` section that lists all the skills. So skills ARE being loaded. But VAN might be talking about something else - maybe the skills aren't being activated or their SKILL.md files aren't being read automatically.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the system prompt, the skills ARE listed in `<available_skills>`. The instruction says to read the SKILL.md when a task matches its description. So skills ARE loading.\n \nVAN might be referring to the AGENTS.md file not being read at session start, or perhaps the skills themselves aren't auto-loading their context. Re-reading VAN's message in Chinese - \"开启新会话后skill没有\" - they're saying that after opening a new session, the skills aren't available. But I can see them in the system prompt, so maybe VAN is pointing out that the AGENTS.md should document how to handle skills at session startup. I'm realizing the skills are actually listed in the system prompt through the available_skills section, so they're being loaded by OpenClaw. But VAN might be pointing out that I'm not proactively reading the skill files or referencing them in new sessions—maybe I should be automatically loading the AGENTS.md or relevant skill docs when a session starts rather than waiting for the user to ask about them.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，skills 是加载了的——我当前系统提示里有 27 个 skill 的描述和路径。但你的意思可能是：**新会话开始时我没有主动读取 skill 的 SKILL.md**，导致技能内容没有进入上下文？\n\n还是说你希望我在 AGENTS.md 里加上**新会话自动加载的技能清单**，比如每次启动时自动读取缠论 skill、交易 skill 等核心 SKILL.md？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":557,"output":759,"cacheRead":105472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106788,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779749697515}}
