{"type":"compaction","id":"20823096","parentId":"5a7cabd0","timestamp":"2026-05-25T23:03:32.434Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Fix the session archiving system that was never triggered (scripts existed but cron jobs were never configured)\n2. Review and organize the complete trading system architecture\n3. Upgrade the \"intelligent trading level determination\" (智能交易级别确立) module — moving from ATR-based volatility scaling to structure-state-based level selection\n4. Establish full local↔GitHub backup/sync mechanism for workspace (ai-trading-sync repo)\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Follow multi-channel unified protocol v1.0 (`multi-channel-protocol.md`)\n- Use workspace file `/workspace/projects/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md` (exact case) for heartbeat checks\n- Trading philosophy: 缠论 (Chan Theory) as foundation, with existential ontology integration\n- Follow \"上次整合的方案\" (previously integrated plan) for archiving\n- No multi-空 distinction in 缠论 — only buy/sell points\n- VAN explicitly rejected ATR-based level scaling: a 5-min trend with 30% gain in days followed by 1-2 months consolidation would be missed if volatility causes level enlargement\n- VAN wants full automation for sync — \"能自动尽量全自动，频率可以按需调调整\"\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Diagnosed archiving failure: cron jobs were zero despite scripts existing\n- [x] Created 3 cron jobs: `auto-memory-hourly` (0 * * * *), `memory-archive-daily` (0 2 * * *), `session-archive-check` (0 */2 * * *)\n- [x] Manually archived current session to `memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-om_x100b6e7ef53204a4c2798d1c95d1da1.md`\n- [x] Updated `memory/2026-05-26.md` with key decisions\n- [x] Produced complete trading system overview (11 modules, 26 skills, data sources, risk engine)\n- [x] Analyzed current intelligent trading level logic in `live_paper_trader.py` — identified 3 structural defects\n- [x] Rewrote `czsc_extension.py` to v2.0 with `StructureState`, `get_structure_state()`, enhanced divergence, trend strength\n- [x] Updated `live_paper_trader.py` with structure-state-driven strategies (follow_trend, catch_reversal, range_breakout, range_scalp)\n- [x] Created GitHub repo `xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync` (private) — full workspace backup (81 files, 16,564 lines, commit 30cc5d4)\n- [x] Added `calc_trend_fluency()` — 流畅度分析, 回调深度权重最高(40%)\n- [x] Backfilled 3 historical session archives from 2026-05-25 (sessions: 2d13d869, 5a140ae3, 82ec077b; skipped probe-* sessions)\n- [x] Created `sync-to-backup.sh` script for automated full sync to GitHub\n- [x] Created `backup-sync` cron job (every 6 hours, ID: `8485293c-0845-44ae-bde9-f9985618b30b`)\n- [x] Created session archive `2026-05-26-feishu-2026-05-26-05to06.md` (05:31-06:05 session)\n- [x] Pushed all archives to backup repo (commits 3ed9fab, 429e1fe, a019f27, 77dca6f)\n- [x] Documented hermes-sync vs ai-trading-sync comparison for VAN\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Upgrading trading level determination from ATR-based to structure-state-based (code written, needs real market data testing)\n- [ ] VAN reviewing whether additional workspace docs should be added to backup config/\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Archive automation fix**: Created 3 cron jobs following multi-channel protocol v1.0 instead of manual-only approach\n- **Structure > Volatility for level selection**: VAN rejected ATR-based approach; agreed to use structural state (trending/ranging/turning) to determine trading level\n- **Level locking during trends**: When trend is active at 5-min level, do NOT enlarge to daily — ride the trend at its native level; only enlarge during consolidation or shrink during reversals\n- **Full automation for sync**: VAN approved 6-hour auto-sync to GitHub; frequency adjustable on demand\n- **Backup scope**: 6 core identity configs (AGENTS/IDENTITY/USER/SOUL/HEARTBEAT/TOOLS) in `config/`; additional workspace docs (BOOTSTRAP, TRADING_SYSTEM, SIGNAL_GENERATOR etc.) not yet backed up — VAN asked about adding them\n- **Two-repo strategy**: hermes-sync = cross-platform identity/soul sync; ai-trading-sync = local system backup (code+memory+config). \"一个管我是谁，一个管我有什么\"\n\n## Next Steps\n1. VAN to decide: add remaining workspace docs (BOOTSTRAP, TRADING_SYSTEM, SIGNAL_GENERATOR, AUTO_MEMORY_*, SESSION_CONTEXT_ANALYSIS, AGENTS_INVESTOR) to backup\n2. Implement `get_structure_state()` testing with real market data via `ChanlunPerception`\n3. Continuously iterate structure-state module (VAN: \"要不断迭代这个模块\")\n4. Update `check_resonance()` to validate buy/sell point level alignment\n5. Periodic review of sync frequency if needed\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Core files**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py` (v2.0 with StructureState, get_structure_state, calc_trend_fluency), `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/live_paper_trader.py` (structure-state-driven strategies)\n- **Key methods**: `determine_trading_direction()` (returns dict with direction/strategy/primary_tf/reason/structure/resonance_level), `get_structure_state()`, `calc_trend_fluency()`, `check_resonance()`\n- **Backup repo**: `xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync` (private GitHub), restored via `git clone + bash restore.sh`\n- **Sync script**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/sync-to-backup.sh` — clones repo, copies memory/sessions/code/scripts/config/knowledge/paper-trading, commits+pushes if changes detected\n- **Cron job IDs**: auto-memory-hourly: `9a9818bf-2187-4837-a018-5d61d1aed863`, memory-archive-daily: `cb8317c3-ce13-427f-832b-2ab441070b42`, session-archive-check: `16bf9536-7ab3-4fa5-bb01-baacee4296da`, backup-sync: `8485293c-0845-44ae-bde9-f9985618b30b`\n- **Session archives**: 6 total (3 from 2026-05-25 backfilled, 3 from 2026-05-26)\n- **Deployed instruments**: CRCL (`crcl_tiger_trader.py`), Xiaomi 01810 (`xiaomi_paper_trader.py`), HK/A-share scanner (`hk_a_monitor.py`)\n- **Risk engine**: 3-tier (technical stop at hub re-entry, time stop at N bars, capital stop at 3% per trade / 8% daily, consecutive loss halt at 3 trades)\n- **VAN's key insight**: \"凡强趋必然浅回调不论多空\" — strong trends必然 have shallow pullbacks\n- **Workspace root has 16 .md files**; only 6 identity configs backed up to `config/`; remaining 9 (excluding SECRET.md) may need backing up per VAN's review\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nVAN requested two things:\n1. Add all remaining `.md` files to the private backup repository (`xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync`) — keeping it private/not public.\n2. Review and restructure the identity configuration files, saying they need to be \"re-sorted and updated.\"\n\n## Early Progress\n- All missing `.md` files were successfully added to the backup repo's `config/` directory: `AGENTS_INVESTOR.md`, `AUTO_MEMORY_DESIGN.md`, `AUTO_MEMORY_README.md`, `BOOTSTRAP.md`, `MEMORY_RECOVERY_REPORT.md`, `SESSION_CONTEXT_ANALYSIS.md`, `SIGNAL_GENERATOR.md`, `TRADING_SYSTEM.md`\n- `MEMORY.md` was placed in `memory/`\n- `TRADING_SYSTEM.md` was also copied to the repo root\n- Commit `e6962aa` pushed to `github.com/xianfanhuang/ai-trading-sync` (private repo) — 9 files changed, 2095 insertions\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- The backup/sync of all `.md` files is complete. The remaining task is the **identity configuration review and update** that VAN mentioned — restructuring/refreshing identity-related config files. The repo uses a structure with `config/`, `memory/`, and root-level trading system docs.\n\n<read-files>\n/workspace/projects/workspace/MEMORY.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ACTION_PLAN.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/chanlun_perception.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/knowledge/chanlun-meta-trading-system.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/cross-channel-protocol.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/multi-channel-protocol.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-om_x100b6e7ef53204a4c2798d1c95d1da1.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/team-identity-registry.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-archive.sh\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/session-archive.sh\n</read-files>\n\n<modified-files>\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/live_paper_trader.py\n/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md\n/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/sync-to-backup.sh\n</modified-files>","firstKeptEntryId":"35d1115c","tokensBefore":122697,"details":{"readFiles":["/workspace/projects/workspace/MEMORY.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ACTION_PLAN.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/ChanlunAgent.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/chanlun_perception.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/reflection_engine.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/risk_engine.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/knowledge/chanlun-meta-trading-system.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/cross-channel-protocol.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/multi-channel-protocol.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-om_x100b6e7ef53204a4c2798d1c95d1da1.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/team-identity-registry.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-archive.sh","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/session-archive.sh"],"modifiedFiles":["/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/live_paper_trader.py","/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md","/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/sync-to-backup.sh"]},"fromHook":false}
